  m_text: '<b>Nine Night and Good Mourning</b>


    Christin Washington


    <i>Spatial
    Audio Installation</i>


    An immersive Afro-Caribbean mourning soundscape
    exploring memory, ritual, grief, and gathering through the sounds of Nine Night
    traditions.'
